{
  "watching": {
    "start": "00:22:14,719",
    "end": "00:28:00,898"
  },
  "fullSubtitles": [
    {
      "start": "00:22:14,719",
      "end": "00:22:16,987",
      "text": "Hey. Hey. Yeah, you."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:22:17,020",
      "end": "00:22:18,523",
      "text": "Little guy, you're here for the audition?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:22:18,556",
      "end": "00:22:20,291",
      "text": "Uh, yes."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:22:20,325",
      "end": "00:22:22,060",
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, yes, we are."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:22:22,093",
      "end": "00:22:24,027",
      "text": "Guys, we're on right now."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:22:24,062",
      "end": "00:22:25,296",
      "text": "- Now? - What?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:22:27,232",
      "end": "00:22:29,367",
      "text": "Your name? Hey, your name, please?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:22:29,401",
      "end": "00:22:32,270",
      "text": "Uh, it's Buster Moon from the New Moon Theater."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:22:32,303",
      "end": "00:22:34,706",
      "text": "And we're very excited to share our story with you today, sir."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:22:34,739",
      "end": "00:22:36,074",
      "text": "Right, guys?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:22:36,107",
      "end": "00:22:38,276",
      "text": "Yeah, great. Now, get to it."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:22:38,309",
      "end": "00:22:39,144",
      "text": "Of course. Yes."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:22:39,177",
      "end": "00:22:41,079",
      "text": "Okay, guys, just like we rehearsed."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:22:44,014",
      "end": "00:22:45,350",
      "text": "This is the story"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:22:45,383",
      "end": "00:22:48,052",
      "text": "of an ordinary high school girl who discovers..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:22:48,086",
      "end": "00:22:49,487",
      "text": "Stop."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:22:49,521",
      "end": "00:22:50,522",
      "text": "Stop?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:22:50,555",
      "end": "00:22:51,556",
      "text": "He wants you to stop."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:22:52,590",
      "end": "00:22:54,292",
      "text": "\"Ordinary\" and \"school.\""
    },
    {
      "start": "00:22:54,325",
      "end": "00:22:56,094",
      "text": "Two words I will never be associated with."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:22:56,127",
      "end": "00:22:58,096",
      "text": "- Never. Never. - Where the heck did you"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:22:58,129",
      "end": "00:22:59,330",
      "text": "dig these guys up from, huh?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:22:59,364",
      "end": "00:23:00,698",
      "text": "If you could all leave very quickly,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:00,732",
      "end": "00:23:02,100",
      "text": "we'd appreciate that, please."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:02,133",
      "end": "00:23:04,102",
      "text": "I need big shows, Jerry."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:04,135",
      "end": "00:23:06,104",
      "text": "- Big ideas! - Yes, sir, big. The biggest."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:06,137",
      "end": "00:23:08,072",
      "text": "Hey, I have a big one."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:09,006",
      "end": "00:23:10,974",
      "text": "Okay, honey. Come on, let's go."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:11,008",
      "end": "00:23:12,677",
      "text": "You know, the sci-fi musical."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:12,710",
      "end": "00:23:14,712",
      "text": "- That's big, right? - Um, uh..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:14,746",
      "end": "00:23:17,115",
      "text": "I mean, it's got the aliens and the robots"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:17,148",
      "end": "00:23:19,484",
      "text": "and the lasers and these amazing songs"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:19,517",
      "end": "00:23:21,219",
      "text": "from, like, Clay Calloway to..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:21,252",
      "end": "00:23:23,688",
      "text": "Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa. Clay Calloway?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:23,721",
      "end": "00:23:25,557",
      "text": "I love Clay Calloway."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:26,424",
      "end": "00:23:27,625",
      "text": "I know, right?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:27,659",
      "end": "00:23:29,060",
      "text": "I mean, doesn't everybody?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:29,093",
      "end": "00:23:30,462",
      "text": "Yeah. Yeah, yeah, yeah. See, Jerry?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:30,495",
      "end": "00:23:33,198",
      "text": "This is exactly the kind of big idea I'm talking about."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:33,231",
      "end": "00:23:34,766",
      "text": "- Yes, sir. - So, uh..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:34,799",
      "end": "00:23:36,568",
      "text": "so what's the show called?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:36,601",
      "end": "00:23:38,770",
      "text": "What's it called? Um..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:38,803",
      "end": "00:23:41,072",
      "text": "- Gunter, you, uh... - you want to..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:41,105",
      "end": "00:23:42,407",
      "text": "...uh, tell Mr. Crystal what it's called?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:42,440",
      "end": "00:23:45,477",
      "text": "Uh-huh. It's called Out of This World."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:46,411",
      "end": "00:23:49,514",
      "text": "Out of This World."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:49,547",
      "end": "00:23:51,683",
      "text": "That's right. Just imagine it."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:51,716",
      "end": "00:23:53,351",
      "text": "Ash?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:53,384",
      "end": "00:23:56,019",
      "text": "Uh, yeah, I got it."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:56,054",
      "end": "00:23:57,789",
      "text": "A spectacular musical"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:57,822",
      "end": "00:24:01,426",
      "text": "that takes your audience out of this world."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:24:01,459",
      "end": "00:24:04,529",
      "text": "♪ I wanna run ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:24:05,530",
      "end": "00:24:08,766",
      "text": "♪ I want to hide ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:24:08,800",
      "end": "00:24:12,737",
      "text": "♪ I wanna tear down the walls ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:24:12,770",
      "end": "00:24:15,373",
      "text": "♪ That hold me inside ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:24:15,406",
      "end": "00:24:16,774",
      "text": "I love this song."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:24:16,808",
      "end": "00:24:20,278",
      "text": "♪ I wanna reach out ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:24:20,311",
      "end": "00:24:24,649",
      "text": "♪ And touch the flame ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:24:24,682",
      "end": "00:24:30,188",
      "text": "♪ Where the streets have no name. ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:24:30,221",
      "end": "00:24:31,756",
      "text": "Sir, your lunch meeting with..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:24:31,789",
      "end": "00:24:33,558",
      "text": "Oh, my..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:24:33,591",
      "end": "00:24:34,759",
      "text": "Not now."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:24:34,792",
      "end": "00:24:36,160",
      "text": "Moon, how did you get in here?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:24:36,194",
      "end": "00:24:37,362",
      "text": "Hey, he said not now. Psst."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:24:37,395",
      "end": "00:24:39,197",
      "text": "Yeah, I heard him. Thanks, Jerry."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:24:39,230",
      "end": "00:24:40,732",
      "text": "Are you telling me you-you got"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:24:40,765",
      "end": "00:24:42,767",
      "text": "Clay Calloway's permission to use his song?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:24:42,800",
      "end": "00:24:45,436",
      "text": "- Well, what if I told you I did? - Ah."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:24:45,470",
      "end": "00:24:46,437",
      "text": "Okay, so what, you got"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:24:46,471",
      "end": "00:24:48,339",
      "text": "some kind of personal connection to this guy?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:24:48,373",
      "end": "00:24:50,675",
      "text": "- How else would I get it? - Moon!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:24:50,708",
      "end": "00:24:52,310",
      "text": "Wait, if you know him,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:24:52,343",
      "end": "00:24:56,281",
      "text": "then you could get him in the show, right?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:24:57,415",
      "end": "00:24:59,384",
      "text": "Oh, that'd be huge for me."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:24:59,417",
      "end": "00:25:00,785",
      "text": "Huge."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:00,818",
      "end": "00:25:02,420",
      "text": "Sir, I'm sorry, but seriously?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:02,453",
      "end": "00:25:04,856",
      "text": "You think this little guy from nowhere"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:04,889",
      "end": "00:25:07,592",
      "text": "can get Clay Calloway in the show?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:09,394",
      "end": "00:25:11,462",
      "text": "Well, Suki, for your information,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:11,496",
      "end": "00:25:15,099",
      "text": "I am not just a little guy from nowhere."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:15,133",
      "end": "00:25:16,834",
      "text": "Consider it done, sir."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:16,868",
      "end": "00:25:18,570",
      "text": "I'll give you three weeks, Moon."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:18,603",
      "end": "00:25:21,239",
      "text": "Three weeks to get this show up and running, okay?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:21,272",
      "end": "00:25:22,840",
      "text": "Yes, sir. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:22,874",
      "end": "00:25:24,576",
      "text": "Moon, do you really know Clay Calloway?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:24,609",
      "end": "00:25:25,710",
      "text": "Shh, shh. Not now."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:25,743",
      "end": "00:25:27,378",
      "text": "- Jerry. - Oh! Right here, sir."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:27,412",
      "end": "00:25:29,614",
      "text": "I want these guys to start work right away."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:29,647",
      "end": "00:25:32,317",
      "text": "Set 'em up with our designers, our dancers, whatever they need."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:32,350",
      "end": "00:25:34,385",
      "text": "And get 'em rooms at the hotel, okay?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:34,419",
      "end": "00:25:36,721",
      "text": "The very best suites. The whole shaboodle."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:36,754",
      "end": "00:25:37,855",
      "text": "Yes, sir. Yes, of course."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:37,889",
      "end": "00:25:39,357",
      "text": "Uh, hey, one last thing."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:39,390",
      "end": "00:25:41,492",
      "text": "Don't you ever do nothing to make me look bad."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:41,526",
      "end": "00:25:42,860",
      "text": "You got that?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:42,894",
      "end": "00:25:44,495",
      "text": "Oh, I will never let that happen, sir."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:44,529",
      "end": "00:25:46,731",
      "text": "You better not, or I'll throw you off the roof."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:48,833",
      "end": "00:25:50,201",
      "text": "Great job, everyone."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:50,234",
      "end": "00:25:52,503",
      "text": "Take it away, Raoul."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:57,508",
      "end": "00:25:58,276",
      "text": "Oh, my gosh."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:58,309",
      "end": "00:26:00,178",
      "text": "- Is this really happening? - Yeah!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:00,211",
      "end": "00:26:02,513",
      "text": "We're playing Redshore City, baby!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:02,547",
      "end": "00:26:05,283",
      "text": "Yes, we are, Gunter."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:05,316",
      "end": "00:26:07,151",
      "text": "Gunter, sci-fi musical?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:07,185",
      "end": "00:26:08,620",
      "text": "You're a genius."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:08,653",
      "end": "00:26:10,521",
      "text": "Yeah, well, Mama always said,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:10,555",
      "end": "00:26:13,725",
      "text": "\"Gunter, you're not as stupid as your papa.\""
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:13,758",
      "end": "00:26:15,493",
      "text": "No, you're not."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:15,526",
      "end": "00:26:16,861",
      "text": "Hey, Suki."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:16,894",
      "end": "00:26:18,329",
      "text": "No hard feelings, huh?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:18,363",
      "end": "00:26:20,665",
      "text": "You have no idea what you're getting into."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:20,698",
      "end": "00:26:21,899",
      "text": "Whoa."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:21,933",
      "end": "00:26:23,401",
      "text": "- Are you out of your mind? - What?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:23,434",
      "end": "00:26:25,570",
      "text": "Clay Calloway? I'm, like, his biggest fan,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:25,603",
      "end": "00:26:27,805",
      "text": "and I can tell you, the guy is a recluse."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:27,839",
      "end": "00:26:29,907",
      "text": "Seriously, after his wife died,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:29,941",
      "end": "00:26:31,909",
      "text": "no one's seen him in over 15 years."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:31,943",
      "end": "00:26:33,878",
      "text": "Ah. That's not good."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:33,911",
      "end": "00:26:35,613",
      "text": "No, it's not."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:35,647",
      "end": "00:26:37,515",
      "text": "Uh..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:37,548",
      "end": "00:26:39,851",
      "text": "Miss Crawly, I need you to help me find Clay Calloway."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:39,884",
      "end": "00:26:41,653",
      "text": "An address, a phone number, anything."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:41,686",
      "end": "00:26:43,921",
      "text": "- But we've got to find that guy. - Yes, sir."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:43,955",
      "end": "00:26:45,256",
      "text": "♪ Think about it... ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:45,289",
      "end": "00:26:46,658",
      "text": "Good morning!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:46,691",
      "end": "00:26:49,427",
      "text": "I'm Linda Le Bon, and have I got some hot news for you."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:49,460",
      "end": "00:26:51,462",
      "text": "♪ Down in the heart or hidden... ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:51,496",
      "end": "00:26:53,831",
      "text": "Infamous billionaire Jimmy Crystal has hired"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:53,865",
      "end": "00:26:55,800",
      "text": "- an unknown theater producer... - What?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:55,833",
      "end": "00:26:58,236",
      "text": "...by the name of Buster Moon."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:58,269",
      "end": "00:27:03,274",
      "text": "♪ Look inside your heart and I'll look inside mine ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:27:03,307",
      "end": "00:27:06,277",
      "text": "♪ Things look so bad everywhere ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:27:06,310",
      "end": "00:27:07,879",
      "text": "♪ Everywhere ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:27:07,912",
      "end": "00:27:12,283",
      "text": "♪ In this whole world, what is fair? ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:27:12,316",
      "end": "00:27:15,286",
      "text": "♪ We walk the line and try to see ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:27:15,319",
      "end": "00:27:17,355",
      "text": "♪ Try to see ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:27:17,388",
      "end": "00:27:20,458",
      "text": "♪ Falling behind in what could be ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:27:20,491",
      "end": "00:27:24,595",
      "text": "♪ Oh, oh, bring me a higher love ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:27:25,596",
      "end": "00:27:30,802",
      "text": "♪ Bring me a higher love, oh ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:27:30,835",
      "end": "00:27:34,539",
      "text": "♪ Bring me a higher love ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:27:34,572",
      "end": "00:27:39,410",
      "text": "♪ Where's that higher love I keep thinking of? ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:27:40,044",
      "end": "00:27:41,813",
      "text": "♪ That love, that love ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:27:41,846",
      "end": "00:27:43,848",
      "text": "♪ Bring me higher love ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:27:43,881",
      "end": "00:27:46,417",
      "text": "♪ Love, that love, that love... ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:27:46,451",
      "end": "00:27:48,720",
      "text": "Okay, so this guy is coming in from that side,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:27:48,753",
      "end": "00:27:50,488",
      "text": "and it's, like, cuckoo crazy,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:27:50,521",
      "end": "00:27:52,457",
      "text": "and then I think we should have, like,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:27:52,490",
      "end": "00:27:55,293",
      "text": "this cool alien tango scene."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:27:55,326",
      "end": "00:27:59,530",
      "text": "\"Alien tango scene.\""
    },
    {
      "start": "00:27:59,564",
      "end": "00:28:00,898",
      "text": "Oh. I love it."
    }
  ],
  "mimicking": [
    {
      "start": "00:22:14,719",
      "end": "00:22:16,987",
      "text": "Hey. Hey. Yeah, you."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:22:20,325",
      "end": "00:22:22,060",
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, yes, we are."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:22:29,401",
      "end": "00:22:32,270",
      "text": "Uh, it's Buster Moon from the New Moon Theater."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:22:36,107",
      "end": "00:22:38,276",
      "text": "Yeah, great. Now, get to it."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:22:52,590",
      "end": "00:22:54,292",
      "text": "\"Ordinary\" and \"school.\""
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:02,133",
      "end": "00:23:04,102",
      "text": "I need big shows, Jerry."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:09,006",
      "end": "00:23:10,974",
      "text": "Okay, honey. Come on, let's go."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:21,252",
      "end": "00:23:23,688",
      "text": "Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa. Clay Calloway?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:26,424",
      "end": "00:23:27,625",
      "text": "I know, right?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:29,093",
      "end": "00:23:30,462",
      "text": "Yeah. Yeah, yeah, yeah. See, Jerry?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:42,440",
      "end": "00:23:45,477",
      "text": "Uh-huh. It's called Out of This World."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:23:53,384",
      "end": "00:23:56,019",
      "text": "Uh, yeah, I got it."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:24:34,792",
      "end": "00:24:36,160",
      "text": "Moon, how did you get in here?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:24:40,765",
      "end": "00:24:42,767",
      "text": "Clay Calloway's permission to use his song?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:00,818",
      "end": "00:25:02,420",
      "text": "Sir, I'm sorry, but seriously?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:15,133",
      "end": "00:25:16,834",
      "text": "Consider it done, sir."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:18,603",
      "end": "00:25:21,239",
      "text": "Three weeks to get this show up and running, okay?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:22,874",
      "end": "00:25:24,576",
      "text": "Moon, do you really know Clay Calloway?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:29,647",
      "end": "00:25:32,317",
      "text": "Set 'em up with our designers, our dancers, whatever they need."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:34,419",
      "end": "00:25:36,721",
      "text": "The very best suites. The whole shaboodle."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:39,390",
      "end": "00:25:41,492",
      "text": "Don't you ever do nothing to make me look bad."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:44,529",
      "end": "00:25:46,731",
      "text": "You better not, or I'll throw you off the roof."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:25:50,234",
      "end": "00:25:52,503",
      "text": "Take it away, Raoul."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:02,547",
      "end": "00:26:05,283",
      "text": "Yes, we are, Gunter."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:07,185",
      "end": "00:26:08,620",
      "text": "You're a genius."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:13,758",
      "end": "00:26:15,493",
      "text": "No, you're not."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:18,363",
      "end": "00:26:20,665",
      "text": "You have no idea what you're getting into."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:33,911",
      "end": "00:26:35,613",
      "text": "No, it's not."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:26:39,884",
      "end": "00:26:41,653",
      "text": "An address, a phone number, anything."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:27:59,564",
      "end": "00:28:00,898",
      "text": "Oh. I love it."
    }
